        ":question/id": "41ade605-a594-51dc-a5e5-aa2a79dd3288",
        ":question/problem": "If $v = \u27e828,-7\u27e9$, then what is the magnitude of $v$?\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question.",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mid v \\mid &= \\sqrt{v_{x}^{2} + v_{y}^{2}} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{(28)^{2} + (-7)^{2}} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{784 + 49} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{833} \\\\\n&= 7 \\sqrt{17}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
