        ":question/id": "816d7973-cac7-5db1-9b8c-ad0a12ecb372",
        ":question/problem": "Let $a = \u27e8-24,6\u27e9$. Find $\\mid a \\mid$.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question.",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Using the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mid a \\mid &= \\sqrt{a_{x}^{2} + a_{y}^{2}} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{(-24)^{2} + (6)^{2}} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{576 + 36} \\\\\n&= \\sqrt{612} \\\\\n&= 6 \\sqrt{17}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
      },
